# PHP in this plugin

Every PHP file must include:

```php
declare( strict_types=1 );

if ( ! defined( 'ABSPATH' ) ) {
	exit;
}
```

- New services: `namespace CT\...;` under `includes/`, one class per file matching the autoload path
- User strings: `__()`, `_e()`, `esc_html__()`, etc. with text domain `customer-tagger`
- Version assets with `CUSTOMER_TAGGER_VERSION`; use `CUSTOMER_TAGGER_*` constants from bootstrap
- Options and public helpers: `ct_` prefix (`ct_settings`, `ct_user_has_tag()`)
- Escape on output; sanitize/validate input; nonces + `manage_woocommerce` (or stricter) for admin/REST

```php
// ❌ BAD
function save_tags() { }
add_option( 'settings', $data );

// ✅ GOOD
namespace CT\Storage;
function ct_get_user_tags( int $user_id ): array { }
add_option( 'ct_settings', $data );
```
